00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:47.915 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La première des priorités pour

00:00:45.179 --> 00:00:49.450 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'adaptation des villes, selon

00:00:46.714 --> 00:00:50.684 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cette chercheuse, c'est :

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:51.919 size:53% position:73% line:53%
SOPHIE VSOPHIE VSOPHIE VAN NEST.

00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:53.153 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en action climatique urbaine

00:00:51.018 --> 00:00:54.355 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Verdir nos infrastructures.

00:00:52.253 --> 00:00:55.589 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Donc, c'est les routes, les

00:00:53.487 --> 00:00:56.824 size:53% position:73% line:53%
