00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:14.842 size:53% position:73% line:53%
RÉMI HAF, conseiller en planif.

00:01:12.139 --> 00:01:16.377 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Service de l'eau, Ville de Mtl

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:18.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les gens se rendent même pas

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:20.414 size:53% position:73% line:53%
