00:01:28.355 --> 00:01:32.626 size:53% position:73% line:53%
inonder les bâtiments.

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:34.161 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les îlots de ch

00:01:31.425 --> 00:01:35.496 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un autre défi en ville.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:36.864 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Depuis 2011, obligation

00:01:34.495 --> 00:01:38.232 size:53% position:73% line:53%
