00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:41.935 size:53% position:73% line:53%
DAVID GRONDIN, arrondissement

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:43.170 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Rosemont-La Petite-Patrie

00:01:41.068 --> 00:01:44.405 size:53% position:73% line:53%
